  "summary": "Tyler Black is a left-handed hitting infield prospect known for his elite plate discipline, on-base ability, and plus speed. He has shown a high contact rate throughout his minor league career. While he possesses good athleticism, his defensive home and arm strength remain a concern, leading to him seeing time at multiple infield positions and even some outfield. He made brief MLB appearances in 2024 but struggled offensively in Triple-A and parts of the big leagues in 2024-2025, including a hamate injury in 2025.",
